{"5233490":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Sort The Bunnies","steam_appid":5233490,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/70b48c6cf2da09a5d62ce60dd39e069b.poster.avif?t=1793278614\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/70b48c6cf2da09a5d62ce60dd39e069b.webm?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/70b48c6cf2da09a5d62ce60dd39e069b.mp4?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mountain of bunnies. A place for every one of them.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort the Bunnies is a cozy first-person organizing simulator. Play solo or with up to three friends in online co-op, turning a shop full of scattered toys into colorful collections.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a match in the pile, carry it to its shelf, and fill that last empty space. Bring matching bunnies together and watch a cluttered shop become a display worth admiring.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/9b5d0ad8f1bc0a81558c733fb3c33e42.poster.avif?t=1793278614\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/9b5d0ad8f1bc0a81558c733fb3c33e42.webm?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/9b5d0ad8f1bc0a81558c733fb3c33e42.mp4?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the shop with up to three friends in online co-op. Split up the sorting, help each other find missing bunnies, or take a break for a completely unnecessary toy fight.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/98e426c2f0ad78628935ce2b09fc00f0.poster.avif?t=1793278614\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/98e426c2f0ad78628935ce2b09fc00f0.webm?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/98e426c2f0ad78628935ce2b09fc00f0.mp4?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins as you sort and spend them on a helping hand. Carry more, reach farther, reveal matching bunnies, and collect nearby matches into your basket.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/cc1c838e31a177c2fded35c5d42f9d66.poster.avif?t=1793278614\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/cc1c838e31a177c2fded35c5d42f9d66.webm?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/cc1c838e31a177c2fded35c5d42f9d66.mp4?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up the claw, make your grab, and see what comes out. Take a break from the shelves to win temporary powers and playful accessories for your bunny.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/c7eb0befa81a4e0374bbbb5e5f5db5b0.poster.avif?t=1793278614\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/c7eb0befa81a4e0374bbbb5e5f5db5b0.webm?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/c7eb0befa81a4e0374bbbb5e5f5db5b0.mp4?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the bunny-ear hoop and turn tidying into target practice. Land a bunny through the hoop and watch it fly to its shelf. A little aim goes a long way.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/b99411041b81af1f2bc49f21fe787e5a.poster.avif?t=1793278614\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/b99411041b81af1f2bc49f21fe787e5a.webm?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/b99411041b81af1f2bc49f21fe787e5a.mp4?t=1793278614\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the pump to puff up a giant version of your favorite bunny. Keep pumping and watch it grow right in front of you. That should be big enough… probably.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/20548f4bc7d0dc4c16249b75ee94cd84.poster.avif?t=1793278614\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5233490\/extras\/20548f4bc7d0dc4c16249b75ee94cd84.webm?t=17932786